<title>UK: WH Smith posts first full-year pretax loss.</title>
<headline>WH Smith posts first full-year pretax loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to June 1</p>
<p>		    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr(post-exceptionals, p) loss 71.4	   vs 23.9 profit</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)		   10.4	   vs 10.4</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)	   15.65	  vs 15.65</p>
<p> Pretax(post-exceptionals) loss 194.7	  vs 100.9 profit</p>
<p> Pretax(pre-exceptionals)	 98.8	   vs 114.5</p>
<p> Turnover			     2,827.9	vs 2,689.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits before exceptionals were in a range of 75.0 to 87.0 million stg.</p>
</text>
